        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Good. It’s just that when he’s focused on his damn cables, there’s no way to speak with him. You know It’s like he doesn’t care about us.",
