        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Right!",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_10"
    },
    "line_10": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Anyways, I don’t really give a crap about him. We'll organize this festival, whether he’s here or not. And if it’s not a festival, it would be something else.",
            "audio": "s4r102.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_11"
    },
    "line_11": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "Such as…",
            "audio": null
        },
        "next": "line_12"
    },
    "line_12": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "cheerful",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "It doesn’t really matter. What matters to me is making people happy. You know the feeling. Once you’re done organizing, and you see the smile on people’s faces...",
            "audio": "s4r104.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_13"
    },
    "line_13": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "cheerful",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "And they thank you because they’re having a blast, I live for that stuff. And I’m convinced we’d do it nonetheless.",
            "audio": "s4r105.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_14"
    },
    "line_14": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "left",
            "text": "Sure, it would be different. We’d have less budget, we’d be less people. I’d hate not to see some of my favorite artists, but in the end we’d all be closer to one another.",
            "audio": "s4r106.mp3"
        },
        "next": "line_15"
    },
    "line_15": {
        "type": "line",
        "left": {
            "chara": "Sarah",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": false
        },
        "right": {
            "chara": "Player",
            "mood": "neutral",
            "focus": true
        },
        "line": {
            "speaker": "right",
            "text": "I see.",
            "audio": null
